    "description": "Title\n: VegaFina Boston Store Kings Zenith Tobacciana Lot Cigarette Boxes Pipe Ashtray\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nBrand\n: Mixed Brands\nColor\n: Multi-color\nCategory\n: Collectibles > Tobacciana\nCategory root\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Add timeless appeal to your collection with this unique tobacciana lot, featuring an array of distinctive items. Included are two vintage cigar boxesVegaFina and Boston Store Kingseach with classic wood construction and vibrant vintage detailing. The lot also presents a rare long clay pipe in its original Zenith box, ideal for display or light use by pipe enthusiasts.\nCollectors will appreciate the Buckingham Bright Cut Plug Tobacco tin, two Marlboro-branded items (cases or boxes), a deep ruby red pressed glass ashtray with ornate floral geometric design, two classic flip-top lighters, a lighter shaped like a gold ingot, and a charming red toy car lighter for novelty appeal. These pieces reflect mid-century style and classic tobacco advertising.\nAll items are pre-owned with moderate visible wear such as minor scuffs or patina, consistent with age and use. This versatile assortment is perfect for vintage display, creative decor, or as an impressive starter kit for new collectors.",
